{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Hey Mel! Long time no talk. Lots has been going on since then!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-ea6ce6b82acf8b16435260e5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.091792+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ea6ce6b82acf8b16435260e5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ea6ce6b82acf8b16435260e5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Hey Caroline! Missed you. Anything new? Spill the beans!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-da8b642e7cdbc2b673b78017", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.115298+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "da8b642e7cdbc2b673b78017", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "da8b642e7cdbc2b673b78017", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Since our last chat, I've been looking into counseling or mental health work more. I'm passionate about helping people and making a positive impact. It's tough, but really rewarding too. Anything new happening with you?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-d28eb8f1dbdf7342770e8261", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.127314+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d28eb8f1dbdf7342770e8261", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d28eb8f1dbdf7342770e8261", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: That's awesome, Caroline! Congrats on following your dreams. Yesterday I took the kids to the museum - it was so cool spending time with them and seeing their eyes light up!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-e09fec68e868ad150d823f27", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.137072+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e09fec68e868ad150d823f27", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e09fec68e868ad150d823f27", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Melanie, that's a great pic! That must have been awesome. What were they so stoked about?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-9f2abb7f19c89e0ee84a48fc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.148597+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9f2abb7f19c89e0ee84a48fc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9f2abb7f19c89e0ee84a48fc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: They were stoked for the dinosaur exhibit! They love learning about animals and the bones were so cool. It reminds me why I love being a mom."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-469a038d2a4f36b6427eae0f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.158613+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "469a038d2a4f36b6427eae0f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "469a038d2a4f36b6427eae0f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Being a mom is awesome. I'm creating a library for when I have kids. I'm really looking forward to reading to them and opening up their minds."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-6c5f1b87d1502f17de5a6c53", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.170386+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6c5f1b87d1502f17de5a6c53", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6c5f1b87d1502f17de5a6c53", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Sounds great! What kind of books you got in your library?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-c6db412f5bb5d053635d1c0c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.182404+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c6db412f5bb5d053635d1c0c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c6db412f5bb5d053635d1c0c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: I've got lots of kids' books- classics, stories from different cultures, educational books, all of that. What's a favorite book you remember from your childhood?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-baa724ca151a17b9fd4adaef", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.192159+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "baa724ca151a17b9fd4adaef", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "baa724ca151a17b9fd4adaef", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: I loved reading \"Charlotte's Web\" as a kid. It was so cool seeing how friendship and compassion can make a difference."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-20421f3c9e2d5d79c04115f4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.201915+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "20421f3c9e2d5d79c04115f4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "20421f3c9e2d5d79c04115f4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Wow, that's great! It sure shows how important friendship and compassion are. It's made me appreciate how lucky I am to have my friends and family helping with my transition. They make all the difference. We even had a picnic last week!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-fa84986e72386ff157571a6c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.211579+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fa84986e72386ff157571a6c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fa84986e72386ff157571a6c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: That's a gorgeous photo, Caroline! Wow, the love around you is awesome. How have your friends and fam been helping you out with your transition?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-70a2b5acbd5a625617107c80", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.226774+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "70a2b5acbd5a625617107c80", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "70a2b5acbd5a625617107c80", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie! This support network has been amazing. They've been there for me every step of the way giving me love, guidance, and acceptance. I couldn't have done it without them."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-50e609b600a32ee92664b55d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.236037+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "50e609b600a32ee92664b55d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "50e609b600a32ee92664b55d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, Caroline! It's great you have people to support you, that's really awesome!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-66ddb2e25865dfe2e2a8bd6a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.253506+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "66ddb2e25865dfe2e2a8bd6a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "66ddb2e25865dfe2e2a8bd6a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: I'm so lucky to have such a great support system around me. Their love and encouragement has really helped me accept and grow into my true self. They've been instrumental in my transition."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-d9cc79e21f23eb510a2c68e3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.266173+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d9cc79e21f23eb510a2c68e3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d9cc79e21f23eb510a2c68e3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Glad you have support, Caroline! Unconditional love is so important. Here's a pic of my family camping at the beach. We love it, it brings us closer!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_6-6fb0587073b6ac74e55a4c3a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:41.278191+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6fb0587073b6ac74e55a4c3a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6fb0587073b6ac74e55a4c3a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
